    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Debora kodi Barak",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 4:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Joisiraili kendo jotimo reco ruwaŋ Rwoth munyo Ehud otieko tho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.4.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.4.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 4:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Rwoth otana jo i cingi Yakin kere ma Kanan, m'oyido dhumo i Hazor, aka jamituka jolweny pere oyido obedo Sisera m'oyido bedo i Haroseth Hagoyim. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.4.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.4.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 4:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Joisiraili joywak ri Rwoth, kole Yakin oyido nitie gi cawilin ma nyweny 900 aka odiyo Joisiraili ma oro piero ario.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.4.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.4.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 4:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.4.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.4.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 4:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I hongo no Debora, cipa Lapidoth, aka jatuci wac Were madhako oyido jathum banja pa Joisiraili. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.4.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.4.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 4:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Debora oyido bedo i tiendi yath thith, i dier Rama kodi Bethel i piny matendere ma Efrayim; aka Joisiraili oyido jokadho malo bongi go thumo rijo banja. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.4.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.4.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 4:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Debora ooro wolwoŋi Barak wod pa Abinowam wok i Kedes Nafital, aka owaco rigo ni, “Rwoth, Were pa Isiraili miyin or, kadhi yu Got Tabor, gi cwo 10,000 wok i nono pa Nafital kodi nono pa Zebulun. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.4.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.4.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 4:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alacoro bongin, i milelo ma Kison, Sisera jamituka pa jolweny pa Yabin, gi cawilin pere kodi jolweny pere, aka alamiyo go i cingin.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.4.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.4.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 4:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.4.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.4.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 4:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Barak odwoko Debora ni, “K'ilakadho kodan, alakadho, to k'ikilakadho kodan, akilakadho.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.4.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.4.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 4:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.4.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.4.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 4:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Debora owaco ri Barak ni, “Alakadho kodin adieri, kareno royo m'ikadh'iye kilakelo rin dwoŋ, kole Rwoth lakitana Sisera i cingi dhako.” Kenyo Debora oay to jokadho gi Barak i Kedes. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.4.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.4.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 4:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Barak olwoŋo nono pa Nafital kodi nono pa Zebulun, to cwo 10,000 joluwo go. Debora okadho malo gi go.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.4.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.4.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 4:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.4.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.4.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 4:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Onyo Heber Jakena oyido opok go kwoŋ nyikway Hobab or Musa, aka go oyido okecere bor gi Jokena to geto wema pere i yath madwoŋ i Zananim, manitie cegin gi Kedes.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.4.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.4.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 4:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.4.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.4.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 4:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Onyo owaci ri Sisera nike Barak wod pa Abinowam oyido okadho i Got Tabor. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.4.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.4.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 4:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sisera ocoko cawilin pere ma nyweny 900 kodi ji je m'oyido jonitie gi go i Haroseth Hagoyim to jokadho i malawa Kison.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.4.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.4.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 4:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.4.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.4.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 4:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Debora owaco ri Barak ni, “Ay, konon me Rwoth miyo Sisera i cingin. Rwoth adieri telo yuwiyin.” Ameno Barak oloro piny wok wi Got Tabor, gi cwo 10,000 ma joluwo go. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.4.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.4.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 4:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Rwoth obolo Sisera gi cawilin pere je kodi jolweny pere i nywowirok ruwaŋ Barak; aka Sisera oloro wok i cawila pere to ringo atiendi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.4.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.4.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 4:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Barak oriemo cawilin kodi jolweny tundo kiri Haroseth Hagoyim. Jolweny je pa Sisera oneki jo g'abor m'ongoye jacwo m'obothi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.4.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.4.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 4:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.4.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.4.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 4:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sisera oringo atiendi kiri i wema pa Yael cipa Heber Jakena; kole siem oyido nitie i dier Kere Yabin ma Hazor kodi Heber Jakena. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.4.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.4.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 4:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yael owok romo gi Sisera, aka owaco ri Sisera ni, “Wire githenge, wire githenge bongan, rwoth paran, Ikir'ilwor.” Sisera owire to donjo i wema, aka oumo go gi kutu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.4.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.4.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 4:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sisera owaco ri Yael ni, “Mondo miye pi nyaka mathin amadhi, riyo nekan.” Yael oyawo cupa cak to miyo go madho, to umo go. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.4.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.4.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 4:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sisera kendo owaco ri Yael ni, “Cungi i dhiot ma wema, aka ka jacwo moro obino to penjin ni, ‘Nitie dhano kenyo?’ Idwoki ni, ‘Ongoye.’”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.4.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.4.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 4:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.4.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.4.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 4:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "To Yael cipa Heber okwanyo luth ma wema kodi nyundu i cinge, aka oliwere to goyo i wic Sisera matek i lowo. Kole Sisera oyido ool swa ma nindo okwalo piyo. Ameno to go tho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.4.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.4.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 4:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Barak obino munyo riemo Sisera, aka Yael owok romo gi go, to waco ni, “Biye, alanyuthin jacwo m'irango.” Munyo Barak obino bonge, neni Sisera oyido oriere piny i lowo m'otho gi luth ma wema i wic mere.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.4.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.4.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 4:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.4.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.4.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 4:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I ndelo no Rwoth okengila Yabin kere ma Kanan ruwaŋ Joisiraili. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.4.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.4.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 4:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cingi Joisiraili olokere matek swa kwoŋ kere Yabin ma Kanan cuka joreyo woko go.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.4.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.4.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
